==History==
2016
*The Witch [[Cards|card]] was added with Clash Royale's game launch on 4/1/2016 {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 11/1/2016, the [[Version History#The First Update (11/1/2016)|First Update]], decreased the Witch's spawned [[Skeletons]] Level by 1 {{Balance|Nerf}}. Before this update, a Level 13 Witch would be able to spawn Level 14 Skeletons.
*On 2/2/2016, the [[Version History#February%202016%20Update%20(2/2/2016)|February 2016 Update]], fixed a bug where the Witch would get stuck if placed in the corner behind a [[:Category:Building Cards|building]] {{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 19/2/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (19/2/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the Witch's damage by 3% {{Balance|Buff}}. In addition, the [[Skeletons]]' hitpoints and damage were increased by 11% {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 29/2/2016, the [[Version History#March 2016 Update (29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update]], changed the Witch so that she would no longer stop her attack if her target dies during the attack animation {{Balance|Neutral}}. It also decreased the Witch's and Skeletons' sight range to 5.5 tiles (from 6 tiles) {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 23/3/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (23/3/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the Witch's damage by 5% {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]], fixed the "range bug" and decreased the Witch's range to 5 tiles (from 5.5 tiles), but her effective range is unchanged {{Balance|Nerf}}. The Skeletons' range was also decreased to 0.5 tiles (from 0.75 tiles), but their effective range was unchanged {{Balance|Nerf}}. Also, before the update, the Witch was able to summon Level 13 Skeletons while the Level cap for the Skeletons card was 12. The [[Goblin Barrel]] was able to do the same with the [[Goblins]].
*On 18/5/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (18/5/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the Witch's damage by 10% {{Balance|Buff}}. In addition, the Skeletons' hitpoints and damage were increased by 5% {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 21/6/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (21/6/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the Witch's damage by 17% {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 19/9/2016, the [[Version History#September%202016%20Update%20(19/9/2016)|September 2016 Update]], made a small change to the Witch's card description {{Balance|Neutral}}.
2017
*On 13/2/2017, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (13/2/2017)|Balance Update]], increased the Witch's damage by 6% {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 12/6/2017, the [[Version History#June 2017 Update (12/6/2017)|June 2017 Update]], increased the Witch's hitpoints by 5% {{Balance|Buff}}, increased her area damage radius to 1.1 tiles (from 1 tile) {{Balance|Buff}}, decreased her spawn time interval to 7 seconds (from 7.5 seconds) {{Balance|Buff}}, and added a 1 second delay in her first spawn {{Balance|Neutral}}.
2018
*On 25/4/2018, the [[Version History#Clan%20Wars%20Update%20(25/4/2018)|Clan Wars Update]], fixed a bug where the Witch would switch targets if spawning Skeletons pushed her target out of range {{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 2/7/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/7/2018)|Balance Update]], increased the Witch's hitpoints by 17% {{Balance|Buff}}, decreased her spawn time interval to 5 seconds (from 7 seconds) {{Balance|Buff}}, and increased her attack time interval to 1 second (from 0.7 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 3/9/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/9/2018)|Balance Update]], decreased the Witch's hitpoints by 3.5% {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Epic}} cards start at Level 6 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 8) {{Balance|Neutral}}.
2019
*On 28/1/2019, the [[Version History#January%202019%20Update%20(28/1/2019)|January 2019 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Witch from [[Training Camp]] to Bone Pit {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 1/4/2019, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (1/4/2019)|Balance Update]], made the Witch spawn 3 additional Skeletons upon death {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 15/4/2019, the [[Version History#April%202019%20Update%20(15/4/2019)|April 2019 Update]], changed the Witch's card description, adding the phrase "''Spawns 3 Skeletons when destroyed.''" to it {{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 7/10/2019, a [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (7/10/2019)|Balance Update]], increased the Witch's damage by 220% {{Balance|Buff}}, decreased her area damage radius to 0.5 tiles (from 1.1 tiles) {{Balance|Nerf}}, decreased her hitpoints by 12% {{Balance|Nerf}}, increased her attack time interval to 1.4 seconds (from 1 second) {{Balance|Nerf}}, decreased her first attack time interval to 0.4 seconds (from 0.5 seconds) {{Balance|Buff}}, and removed the 3 Skeletons that spawned upon death {{Balance|Remove}}. Her spawn time interval was also increased to 7 seconds (from 5 seconds) {{Balance|freN}}, she now spawns Skeletons in a plus shape around her {{Balance|Neutral}}, and the Skeletons now all spawn immediately {{Balance|Neutral}}. Her sound effects also changed slightly {{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 4/11/2019, a [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (4/11/2019)|Balance Update]], removed the Witch's area damage {{Balance|Remove}}, decreased her attack time interval to 1.7 seconds (from 1.4 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}, increased her first attack time interval to 0.7 seconds (from 0.4 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}, and increased the first spawn time interval to 3.5 seconds (from 1 second) {{Balance|Nerf}}. Her mass was also increased to 8 (from 4) {{Balance|Buff}}. The "''Spawns 3 Skeletons when destroyed.''" line from her description was also removed {{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], added area damage to the Witch's attacks {{Balance|Add}}, decreased her damage by 49% {{Balance|Nerf}}, decreased her attack time interval to 1.1 seconds (from 1.7 seconds) {{Balance|Buff}}, and increased her first attack time interval to 1 second (from 0.7 seconds) {{Balance|Buff}}. It also added a card render to the Witch's card info screen {{Balance|Add}}.
2020
*On 4/2/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/2/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the Witch's first attack time interval to 0.7 seconds (from 1 second) {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 9/12/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (9/12/2020)|Balance Update]], increased the first spawn time interval to 1 second (from 3.5 seconds) {{Balance|Buff}}.
2021
*On 30/3/2021, the [[Version History#2021%20Quarter%201%20Update%20(30/3/2021)|2021 Quarter 1 Update]], increased the Witch's range to 5.5 tiles (from 5 tiles) {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Witch from Bone Pit to Spell Valley {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13) {{Balance|Buff}}.
2022
*On 3/2/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(3/2/2022)|Balance Update]], made it so that the [[Ram Rider]]'s snare ability would no longer affect the spawn speed of the Witch {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 28/4/2022, a maintenance break, changed the Witch's card image and card render {{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Witch from Spell Valley to P.E.K.K.A's Playhouse {{Balance|Nerf}}.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14) {{Balance|Buff}}.
2025
*On 8/1/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/1/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Witch's area radius radius to 1.5 tiles (from 1 tile) {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], increased the Witch's hitpoints by 0.11% {{Balance|Buff}} and her damage by 0.74% {{Balance|Buff}}.
*On 5/5/2025, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (5/5/2025)|May 2025 Update]], added the Witch's Evolution {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 4/8/2025, the [[Version History/2025#Pass Royale and more (4/8/2025)|August 2025 Update]] made it so that the [[Witch/Evolution|Evolved Witch]] would no longer be healed by defeated Skeletons {{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 6/10/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2025)=|Balance Update]] increased the Skeleton's attack time interval to 1.1 seconds (from 1 second) {{Balance|Nerf}}.

